# Constant Contact

> Constant Contact is a comprehensive digital marketing platform built for small businesses, nonprofits, agencies, and large organizations. It provides integrated tools for email marketing, SMS, social media scheduling, event promotion, and automated marketing workflows.

## Platform Overview
- [Constant Contact Homepage](https://www.constantcontact.com/): High-level overview of the platform's digital marketing capabilities and target markets.
- [Pricing Plans](https://www.constantcontact.com/pricing): Current subscription tiers, feature limits, and cost details for Lite, Standard, and Premium plans.

## Core Features & Capabilities
- [Email Marketing](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/email-marketing): Specifications for the email campaign builder, delivery tracking, and contact management.
- [Email Templates](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/email-templates): Information on the pre-built template library, custom HTML options, and brand customization tools.
- [SMS Marketing](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/sms-marketing): Overview of text message marketing capabilities, list-building compliance, and campaign management.
- [Social Media Marketing](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/social-media-marketing): Details on social media scheduling, cross-platform posting, and ad campaign management.
- [Ecommerce](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/ecommerce): Tools for syncing product catalogs, abandoned cart emails, and integrating with platforms like Shopify or WooCommerce.
- [Event Marketing](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/event-marketing): Tools for event creation, registration tracking, ticketing, and promotional communications.

## Marketing Tools
- [Marketing Automation](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/automation): Documentation on automated email sequences, triggered responses, and workflow building.
- [AI Content Generation](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/ai): Capabilities of integrated AI writing assistance for generating email, SMS, and social media content.
- [Integrations](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/integrations): Information on connecting third-party applications, CRMs, and APIs.
- [List-Building Tools](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/list-building): Details on landing pages, sign-up forms, lead generation, and subscriber management.
- [Reporting & Analytics](https://www.constantcontact.com/features/reporting): Metrics for campaign performance, open rates, click tracking, and audience engagement insights.

## Solutions
- [Teams and Multi-Account](https://www.constantcontact.com/solutions/teams): Multi-account management and locked-template tools for franchises, universities, and multi-location groups.
- [Agencies](https://www.constantcontact.com/solutions/agencies): Partner program details for agencies and freelancers managing client accounts.

## Documentation & API
- [Knowledge Base](https://knowledgebase.constantcontact.com/): Comprehensive library of technical guides, how-to articles, and platform troubleshooting.
- [Developer Portal & API](https://developer.constantcontact.com/): Official API reference, SDKs, authentication documentation, and integration guides.
